==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage can get very challenging very fast when your units reach the enemy base, since Bun Bun Black has very high pushing power and is paired with both multiple Easter Duches and a Lucky Sloth. Stall as long as you need to at the beginning to kill off the Gory Darks and collect the money from them. For taking on the enemies after the base is hit, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cats]] can deal significant damage to Bun Bun Black and outrange Easter Duche, while [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can deal additional damage to Bun Bun Black when properly supported. Once Bun Bun Black and the Easter Duches are dealt with, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can quickly eliminate Lucky Sloth and victory is practically guaranteed at this point.

